{
 "lessonId": "lesson-21-fetch",
 "allow": [
  "html",
  "css",
  "js"
 ],
 "topic": {
  "ru": "fetch и JSON",
  "uz": "fetch va JSON",
  "en": "fetch and JSON"
 },
 "sections": {
  "1": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "fetch",
    "uz": "fetch",
    "en": "fetch"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Запросим список пользователей с сервера.",
    "uz": "Serverdan foydalanuvchilar ro'yxatini so'raymiz.",
    "en": "Let's request a list of users from a server."
   },
   "files": {
    "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>JS</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <ul class=\"users\"></ul>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "style.css": "",
    "script.js": ""
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "fetch\\(\\s*[\"\\']https?://",
     "say": {
      "ru": "`fetch(\"https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users\")`",
      "uz": "`fetch(\"https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users\")`",
      "en": "`fetch(\"https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users\")`"
     },
     "show": "fetch(\"https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users\")"
    },
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "\\.then\\(\\s*\\(?\\s*\\w+\\s*\\)?\\s*=>\\s*\\w+\\.json\\(\\s*\\)\\s*\\)",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Ответ в данные: `.then((res) => res.json())`",
      "uz": "Javobni ma'lumotga: `.then((res) => res.json())`",
      "en": "Response to data: `.then((res) => res.json())`"
     },
     "show": ".then((res) => res.json())"
    },
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "\\.then\\([\\s\\S]*\\.then\\(\\s*\\(?\\s*\\w+\\s*\\)?\\s*=>",
     "say": {
      "ru": "И второй then: `.then((data) => console.log(data))`",
      "uz": "Va ikkinchi then: `.then((data) => console.log(data))`",
      "en": "And a second then: `.then((data) => console.log(data))`"
     },
     "show": ".then((data) => console.log(data))"
    }
   ],
   "open": "script.js"
  },
  "2": {
   "title": {
    "ru": ".catch",
    "uz": ".catch",
    "en": ".catch"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Поймаем ошибку, если сети нет.",
    "uz": "Tarmoq bo'lmasa xatoni ushlaymiz.",
    "en": "Let's catch an error if there's no network."
   },
   "files": {
    "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>JS</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <p class=\"msg\"></p>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "style.css": "",
    "script.js": "fetch(\"https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users\")\n  .then((res) => res.json())\n  .then((data) => console.log(data.length))\n"
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "\\.catch\\(\\s*\\(?\\s*\\w+\\s*\\)?\\s*=>",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Допиши в конце `.catch((err) => …)`",
      "uz": "Oxiriga `.catch((err) => …)` qo'sh",
      "en": "Add `.catch((err) => …)` at the end"
     },
     "show": "  .catch((err) => console.log(\"Ошибка:\", err));"
    }
   ],
   "open": "script.js"
  }
 },
 "homework": {
  "title": {
   "ru": "5 элементов из API",
   "uz": "API dan 5 ta element",
   "en": "5 items from an API"
  },
  "intro": {
   "ru": "Возьми публичный API и выведи 5 элементов на страницу списком.",
   "uz": "Ochiq API ni olib, sahifaga 5 ta elementni ro'yxat qilib chiqar.",
   "en": "Take a public API and show 5 items on the page as a list."
  },
  "files": {
   "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>JS</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h1>Пользователи</h1>\n  <ul class=\"list\"></ul>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
   "style.css": "",
   "script.js": ""
  },
  "steps": [
   {
    "file": "script.js",
    "re": "fetch\\(\\s*[\"\\']https?://",
    "say": {
     "ru": "Запрос: `fetch(\"https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users\")`",
     "uz": "So'rov: `fetch(\"https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users\")`",
     "en": "Request: `fetch(\"https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users\")`"
    },
    "show": "fetch(\"https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users\")\n  .then((res) => res.json())\n  .then((data) => {\n\n  });"
   },
   {
    "file": "script.js",
    "re": "\\.slice\\(\\s*0\\s*,\\s*5\\s*\\)",
    "say": {
     "ru": "Только пять: `data.slice(0, 5)`",
     "uz": "Faqat beshta: `data.slice(0, 5)`",
     "en": "Only five: `data.slice(0, 5)`"
    },
    "show": "data.slice(0, 5).forEach((user) => {\n\n});"
   },
   {
    "file": "script.js",
    "re": "createElement\\(\\s*[\"\\']li[\"\\']\\s*\\)[\\s\\S]*\\.(append|appendChild)\\(",
    "say": {
     "ru": "Каждому — `<li>` в список",
     "uz": "Har biriga — ro'yxatga `<li>`",
     "en": "Each gets an `<li>` in the list"
    },
    "show": "const li = document.createElement(\"li\");\nli.textContent = user.name;\nlist.append(li);"
   },
   {
    "file": "script.js",
    "re": "\\.catch\\(",
    "say": {
     "ru": "И `.catch` на случай ошибки",
     "uz": "Va xato bo'lsa `.catch`",
     "en": "And `.catch` in case of an error"
    },
    "show": ".catch((err) => console.log(err));"
   }
  ],
  "open": "script.js"
 }
}
